      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. Discovery of Vaccines"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "as5pqcp",
      "content": "Edward Jenner developed the first vaccine against smallpox. Louis Pasteur further developed vaccines for rabies and anthrax. Vaccination stimulates active immunity by introducing weakened or killed pathogens. "
    },
